/T (Tariffs can reduce profitability and liquidity, forcing reassessment of deferred tax asset realizability. Companies may need to record valuation allowances or reconsider indefinite reinvestment assertions on foreign earnings. Forecasting effective tax rates becomes more complex when profitability is volatile or close to breakeven, making year-to-date actual rates a more reliable estimate in some cases.)
/E (Tariffs can reduce profitability and liquidity, forcing reassessment of deferred tax asset realizability. Companies may need to record valuation allowances or reconsider indefinite reinvestment assertions on foreign earnings. Forecasting effective tax rates becomes more complex when profitability is volatile or close to breakeven, making year-to-date actual rates a more reliable estimate in some cases.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [10]
>>
